  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The man is the 'voila!' presenter of the fresh batch of baked goods",
  "description": "The text 'voila! fresh batch of baked goods!' is directly mapped onto the visual entity of the man presenting the tray. The man, as the central figure, is the one performing the action of presenting, and the text explicitly labels his action and the object (baked goods) as the successful outcome being announced. This creates an analogical mapping where the man is the agent of the 'voila!' announcement, and the baked goods are the object of his pride. The text 'voila!' functions as a theatrical declaration that the man is making, thus mapping the visual presentation to the textual declaration.",
